        "original_id": "744bb734-b892-5f20-9533-e629ed3dab54",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Robinsons Galleria, SM Megamall, Galleria Corporate Center\n- Topics: shopping malls, mixed-use complexes, location, size\n\nFacts:\n- Robinsons Galleria, also called Robinsons Galleria Ortigas, is a mixed-use complex and shopping mall at EDSA corner Ortigas Avenue in Quezon City near SM Megamall.\n- SM Megamall is a shopping mall in the Ortigas business district of Metro Manila, Philippines.\n- Galleria Corporate Center is located beside Robinsons Galleria.\n- SM Megamall consists of two buildings connected by a bridge.\n- SM Megamall occupies about 10 hectares of land and has a total floor area of 474,000 square meters.\n- SM Megamall is the second largest shopping mall in the Philippines and the fourth largest in the world.",
